      "severity": "major",
      "description": "GPT5n Romance cast Titanic Growth — a combat trick that gives +4/+4 — on the opponent's Boggart Brute instead of their own Feral Prowler. Titanic Growth is a buff spell; casting it on an enemy creature makes that creature a 7/6 menace attacker, which is catastrophic. This wastes the card and actively helps the opponent.",
