    {
      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "Passed priority in postcombat main phase without playing Ash Barrens as a land. With Brood Monitor (6 mana) in hand, getting to 7 lands would enable casting it next turn. Playing Ash Barrens now ensures they can deploy their most impactful card as soon as possible.",
