    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Cast Feline Sovereign before playing a Forest, using all 3 mana. Playing a Forest first would have given 4 mana, allowing both Feline Sovereign (3 mana) and Skyway Sniper (1 mana) to be cast this turn. Skyway Sniper would also get +1/+1 from Feline Sovereign, becoming a 2/3 with reach.",
