    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Gem3P Tactic timed out and failed to declare attackers. Boggart Brute has menace and cannot be blocked by a single creature. The opponent has Feline Sovereign (2/3, summoning sick) and Skyway Sniper (1/2, summoning sick) — both are sick and cannot block. Even if they weren't sick, the opponent would need two creatures to block the Brute. Goblin Arsonist could also attack since the opponent has no untapped blockers (all creatures are summoning sick). This was a free attack for at least 4 damage (3 from Brute + 1 from Arsonist) with no risk.",
